{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Fotospots 是一張由使用者親手建立的地圖，專門記錄值得拍攝的地點。軟件由空白開始，隨著每次按下快門而逐步累積，適合喜歡攝影與四處探索風景的人。原價 US $0.99，現時限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>建立專屬攝影地點地圖</h2>\n<p>儲存地點時可挑選剛拍下的照片，圖釘會落在拍攝位置與時間，並可補上關於光線或角度的短註，再以霧氣、潮汐等標籤分類。未去過的地方可先加入願望清單，出發前查看街景。主畫面小工具顯示地點、城市與本月數量，透過 Spotlight 可尋回舊地點，亦可請 Siri 代為記錄，分享時只限指定一人。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-140-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-141-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-282-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-283-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-284-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-285-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Fotospots: Find Photo Spots</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-28T20:38:58.106389+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":315,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}